# HeliSim ignores.

# Byte code, regenerated by the interpreter.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The scratch that was swept out of the root on 2026-09-28: page image crops
# and per-page extraction dumps from the reference PDFs, the pre-scenery
# main.py, and the throwaway greps that went with them.  Kept on disk because
# the numbers in the physics modules can be traced back through it, but it is
# not part of the project - see attic/README.md.
attic/

# The reference documents themselves: third party PDFs and their 83 scanned
# flight manual pages, 42 MB that nobody needs to clone.  The OCR text files
# that the physics quotes are NOT ignored - those are small and are the point.
reference/*.pdf
reference/fm_pages/

# main.py's key log: the last flight's keystrokes and telemetry, written beside
# main.py and overwritten by the next run.  main.py --no-log does not write one.
keylog.txt

# What the scripted pilot scribbles: the console transcripts, compile dumps,
# probe output and main.py excerpts that accumulated in the root while the seven
# _rt_ modules were being worked out - _rt_log.txt, _rt_demo_log.txt,
# _rt_handling.txt, _rt_axes.txt and _rt_autoro_probe.txt are written by those
# runs themselves, and sim_demo.txt is simulation.py's own demo.  The modules
# are NOT ignored - _rt_pilot.py, _rt_check.py, _rt_demo.py, _rt_probe.py,
# _rt_handling.py, _rt_axes.py and _rt_autoro_probe.py are the harness and are
# tracked; only what a run prints on its way through is not.
_m*.txt
_rt_*.txt
sim_demo.txt

# What the _tmp_ tools scribbled, and the one of them that is NOT ignored:
# _tmp_shadow.py is tracked, because the Done entries in TODO.md verify
# _rt_axes.py and _rt_handling.py with it and a check nobody can run is not one.
# The other six - the sweeps, probes and one-flight diagnostics the autorotation
# cushion and the manual's flare were read with - went to attic/ on 2026-10-21,
# which is already ignored, and what they wrote (_tmp_*.txt, and the log_*.txt a
# detached run leaves) is scratch wherever it lands.
_tmp_*.py
!_tmp_shadow.py
_tmp_*.txt
log_*.txt
